# Anchors for riscv64. scripts/gen-mirrorlist writes the
# Server lines first and the Fallback line last, each in this order. It never
# ranks or drops them. At least one must answer.
#
# The Fallback is the GHCR mirror (pkgforge-dev/mirror-archlinux). It can be
# hours behind upstream, so a consumer reads it only when every other server
# fails. The build stage reads it first (use-transport).
#
# The Server is the Arch Linux RISC-V server on Arch Linux infrastructure.
Server = https://riscv.mirror.pkgbuild.com/repo/$repo
Fallback = https://ghcr.mirror.archlinux.pkgforge.dev/$arch/$repo
